    "draft": false,
    "readyForModeration": false,
    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">You are given a starting number <var>N</var> and a target number <var>M</var>.<br>The goal is to apply a sequence of operations starting from <var>N</var> in order to obtain the value <var>M</var>.<br><br>There are <strong>4 possible operations</strong>:<br>    &bull; add <var>A</var>,<br>    &bull; subtract <var>B</var>,<br>    &bull; multiply by <var>C</var>,<br>    &bull; divide by <var>D</var>, provided that the result is an integer,<br><br>where <var>A</var>, <var>B</var>, <var>C</var>, and <var>D</var> are integers given in the input.<br>You need to note that all intermediate results must remain within the interval <const>[0, 100000]</const>.<br><br>Determine whether there exists a sequence of operations that allows you to go from the starting number to the target number.<br><br>Note: The operations can repeat.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Four integers separated by spaces: <var>A</var>, <var>B</var>, <var>C</var>, <var>D</var>.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> Two integers separated by a space, <var>N</var> and <var>M</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> <const>1</const> if it is possible to go from <var>N</var> to <var>M</var>, and <const>0</const> otherwise.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &le; <var>A</var>, <var>B</var>, <var>C</var> &le; 10000<br>0 &le; <var>D</var> &le; 1000<br>0 &le; <var>N</var>, <var>M</var> &le; 100000</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">10 4 2 3\n21 32</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
